    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Can you add some details about the pros and cons of each? Specifically, I want to mention the risk of a \"single point of failure\" with vertical scaling and how horizontal scaling handles unexpected traffic spikes better, but maybe phrase it in a way that's easy to grasp for a business executive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
